# ---------------------------------------------------------------- West and Fire Plume Ridge

step Krakle
  tip Ride west past Marshal's Refuge and south down the western side to Golakka Hot Springs: Krakle the goblin sits by the water.
  accept 974

step The crater
  tip Tar Beasts wallow in the Lakkari Tar Pits; the fire elementals of Fire Plume Ridge in the middle carry the ash; the Gorishi wasps of the Slithering Scar in the south carry the gland. Every creature in the crater can drop Un'Goro Soil.
  tip Careful: Gorishi Workers that drop below 45% health have a 50% chance to call for help from allies within 25 yd.
  collect 11837 quest 4496.1          -- Gorishi Scent Gland

step Torwa Pathfinder
  turnin 4291
  tip Ride south along the eastern cliffs to Torwa at the foot of the ramp.
  accept 4289                         -- The pelts come after loop 2, on the gorilla plateau

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- East side

step Torwa Pathfinder
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip Ride down the ramp into the crater: Torwa camps at its foot.
  accept 4292

step Lakkari Tar Pits: kill these as you meet them
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip The gorillas live on Ironstone Plateau, east of Marshal's Refuge. Keep their pelts for Torwa Pathfinder. Stay out of the deepest cave: U'cha is level 55.
  tip Careful: Un'Goro Gorillas (level 50-51) call for help from allies within 20 yd once they drop to 25% health. There is a cave full of apes in the area, and fighting there brings many adds.
  kill 9166 quest 4501                -- Pterrordax
  collect 11478 quest 4289            -- Un'Goro Gorilla Pelt; below ground
  collect 11479 quest 4289            -- Un'Goro Stomper Pelt; below ground
  collect 11480 quest 4289            -- Un'Goro Thunderer Pelt; below ground

step Torwa Pathfinder
  turnin 4289
  accept 4301

