  tip Ride north along the east side to the gorilla plateau. U'cha, a level 55 gorilla, sits in its deepest cave: clear the gorillas at the cave mouth first.
  collect 11476 quest 4301.1          -- Below ground

step Lar'korwi
  tip Lar'korwi's lair lies in the jungle north of Torwa, below the eastern cliffs: use Torwa's Pouch there. Lar'korwi is level 56: start at full health.
